WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
When Clécio took office at city hall, local healthcare was in bad shape.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
No medicine, no doctors. The clinics were a mess.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Clécio transformed Macapá's healthcare, together with the people who work in it.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Every clinic improved, new ones were built,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
and Clécio left everything in place for Macapá to keep its good care.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Clécio changed Macapá. Now he'll transform Amapá.
